      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    par_value = 100\n    five_year_par_rate = 0.0437\n    annual_coupon = par_value * five_year_par_rate\n    earlier_spot_rates = [0.025, 0.030, 0.035, 0.040]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_value_earlier_coupons = sum(\n        annual_coupon / (1 + spot_rate) ** year\n        for year, spot_rate in enumerate(earlier_spot_rates, start=1)\n    )\n    final_cash_flow = par_value + annual_coupon\n    five_year_spot_rate = (\n        final_cash_flow / (par_value - present_value_earlier_coupons)\n    ) ** (1 / 5) - 1\n    answer = round(five_year_spot_rate * 100, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
